LSTM Language Model
Original notebook author: Arian Abdollahi
Source: https://www.kaggle.com/code/arianabdollahi/language-model-with-lstm

This repository preserves the original notebook source and adapts it into a
Python package with separate data, model, training, evaluation, and text
generation modules. The adaptation corrects embedding input, sequence tails,
global state, sampling, and checkpoint handling, and adds tests and docs.

The source notebook is displayed under Apache License 2.0 on Kaggle.
A saved learning curve is reproduced unchanged with source attribution.
Full training corpora and model weights are not distributed with this code.
Dataset terms remain separate from the code license.
